SCOPE OF THIS MIT GRANT
=======================

The MIT License above covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository.

Two categories of material are deliberately NOT covered by it:

  1. BRAND ASSETS - all rights reserved.
     The Plarena name, the Plarena logotype, and the Plarena robot mascot,
     including every pose and size tier and the MASCOT / ICONS vector-path
     tables embedded in the apps. You may run, study, fork and redistribute
     the code, but you may not use these marks to brand a derivative product,
     merchandise, or service without written permission from Xian Su.

  2. COURSE CONTENT AND DATA - Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0).
     The instructional text rendered inside the apps, the Map-1 dataset and
     its certification reports, and the pinned teaching numbers. Reuse,
     remix and adapt them freely - in your own course, deck or paper -
     provided you give attribution.

Full statement, including the attribution format: see BRAND.md.

